 "discovery_notes": "Loungefly 2017 sweep, 29 standard search-snippet queries. No Disney pin credited to Loungefly with a 2017 date was found; Funko's SDCC/NYCC 2017 Loungefly posts list bags only. Recorded instead are 2017 BoxLunch Disney pin leads from Disney Pins Blog (Feb wave, Jun hat pins, Aug Guardians, Sep-Oct Halloween) keyed boxlunch- only because no source names Loungefly as maker (DuckTales set has a single reseller Loungefly attribution). BoxLunch product pages are undated and matched to 2017 posts by name/price only. Hat pins recorded one per character as DPB names each hat and prices per pin. Evil Queen slider comes from a reader comment; weak."
